"P826921751" "Alright, {VillainName}, I got a problem with one of my 'business partners'. I did a bit of work for Crey Industries on the side a while back, but they still haven't come through on the payment! <A HREF={ACCEPT}>Head over to the local Crey tech labs, bust it up, find out what they've been working on, and try to get the money they owe me!</A>"
