// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P1350795636" "So Dr. Quatrexin went over to Malta and is building a suit of power armor to rival my own. I cannot allow this to happen. But Malta is a very powerful group, and Arachnos has an understanding with them. And yet, having Quatrexin running loose and outside of Arachnos control - but more importantly out of MY control - is a dangerous prospect.<br><br>I hate to do this, but I think it is necessary. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>Speak with Arbiter Daos and inform him of our current predicament.</A>"
// AcceptString :
"P1279623180" "Deal with the Malta problem"
// SendOffString :
"P3082072239" "Arbiter Daos will likely be angry because I was working with Crey. At this point, it doesn't matter, because Quatrexin is the larger problem here."

