// IntroString :
"P1271311345" "At last we found the treacherous Dr. Quatrexin! We've traced the shipment of the power suit to a warehouse in Independence Port. Now we shall crush him and his Malta allies, and then the secrets of the Scorpion suit will be mine and mine alone! <A HREF={ACCEPT}>Go to the Malta base in Paragon City and destroy Dr. Quatrexin!</A>"
// AcceptString :
"P2748236861" "Defeat Dr. Quatrexin"
// SendOffString :
"P1158354398" "Victory is close at hand! I will be the one true Black Scorpion!"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P40829855" "Have you defeated Dr. Quatrexin yet? Then go! His destruction must be complete!"

