// Dialog :
"P4223860085" "At last, my old mentor is defeated and the secrets of the Scorpion armor will remain with me! Excellent work, {VillainName}.<br><br>Perhaps it's time I shared some of my secrets with you. But not all of them! Now you can get powers inspired by me, the most powerful of Recluse's lieutenants. Why, I'm so powerful I'll even grant you the power to mess with your abilities so you can be powerful like me! Just go talk to Arbiter Lupin in Nerva. Tell him you're my new Number 1 guy!"
// RandomFameString :
"P3453754169" "I hear {VillainName} is Black Scorpion's new Number 1 guy! I wonder what happened to the last one?"

